From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:54:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] printk: export kmsg_dump_desc for module cold-reset
 diagnostics

The VXD shutdown fail-safe is a GPL module. Allow it to dump emergency
evidence before a cold reset, matching the built-in GPU and PCIe paths.
No printk behavior changes.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 kernel/printk/printk.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/kernel/printk/printk.c b/kernel/printk/printk.c
index fcc51b699..a812ec1e5 100644
--- a/kernel/printk/printk.c
+++ b/kernel/printk/printk.c
@@ -4882,6 +4882,7 @@ void kmsg_dump_desc(enum kmsg_dump_reason reason, const char *desc)
 	}
 	rcu_read_unlock();
 }
+EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(kmsg_dump_desc);
 
 /**
  * kmsg_dump_get_line - retrieve one kmsg log line
